the `seq` PK, so first/last-by-seq gives the same wall span instantly: snapshot
**49.7s → 11.9s**, identical result. (My additions were 0.1s, not the cause.)
Perf-only, result-identical, so untestable in isolation beyond the existing
wall_seconds assertion; residual ~12s is COUNT(*)/GROUP-BY over big tables, left
for later.

